        "mi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ e pā ana ki %@. Ka whakamahi te tirohanga ora i te raraunga i te wā e mātakitaki ana tētahi. E whakapae ana ngā topenga %@ o te nekehanga ia rā (ngā rā 7 whakamutunga)."
