        "mi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Kāore tēnei hub e hoatu waehere haumaru e takina ana ki tōna kī, nō reira kāore he mea e whakaatu ana nā tō pūrere tēnei tono. Ka taea e te tangata e taea ana te toro ki te hub te tono kia uru i raro i tetahi ingoa, ā, ka taea e te pūrere kua whakaaetia te whakamahi i ngā mea e tiria ana e te hub. Whakaae anake mēnā i tono koe ināianei mai i tō pūrere ake, ā, kāore tētahi atu i taea."
